WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.667 --> 00:00:17.712
"Have you seen a man with red hair?" said Dr. Dolittle.

2
00:00:17.713 --> 00:00:20.818
"What's his ship called?" asked a dolphin.

3
00:00:20.819 --> 00:00:22.614
"The Saucy Sally.

4
00:00:22.615 --> 00:00:26.080
Please find him."

5
00:00:26.081 --> 00:00:29.124
Dr. Dolittle waited for the dolphins.

6
00:00:29.125 --> 00:00:32.644
"We found the boat," one dolphin said.

7
00:00:32.645 --> 00:00:35.878
"But there was no one inside," said the other.

8
00:00:35.879 --> 00:00:40.475
"And we didn't find any body in the water," said the first one.

9
00:00:40.476 --> 00:00:44.994
"He is not in the ocean," the second one said.

10
00:00:44.995 --> 00:00:48.495
Dr. Dolittle told the boy what the dolphins said.

11
00:00:48.496 --> 00:00:50.933
"My uncle is alive!"

12
00:00:50.934 --> 00:00:53.398
The boy clapped his hands.

13
00:00:53.399 --> 00:00:55.873
All the animals were happy too.

14
00:00:55.874 --> 00:01:03.496
They danced and sang together.

15
00:01:03.497 --> 00:01:07.379
After eating a big meal, Dr. Dolittle said:

16
00:01:07.380 --> 00:01:11.040
"Now we must continue to search for your uncle."

17
00:01:11.041 --> 00:01:15.567
"Dr. Dolittle, ask the eagles," Dab-Dab whispered.

18
00:01:15.568 --> 00:01:19.411
"Eagles can see better than any other creature."

19
00:01:19.412 --> 00:01:22.909
Dr. Dolittle called and spoke with two eagles.

20
00:01:22.910 --> 00:01:25.092
Eagles don't like to talk much.

21
00:01:25.093 --> 00:01:27.657
But they agreed to help the good doctor.

22
00:01:27.658 --> 00:01:34.138
"We'll be back," one said in a deep voice.

23
00:01:34.139 --> 00:01:37.227
That evening, the eagles returned to the ship.

24
00:01:37.228 --> 00:01:39.008
"We searched everywhere.

25
00:01:39.009 --> 00:01:42.800
But this man is nowhere to be seen," said one eagle.

26
00:01:42.801 --> 00:01:45.326
The other one didn't say a word.

27
00:01:45.327 --> 00:01:48.716
"He is not on land," continued the eagle.

28
00:01:48.717 --> 00:01:52.864
They bowed their heads and flew off.

29
00:01:52.865 --> 00:01:56.034
Dr. Dolittle did not know what to do.

30
00:01:56.035 --> 00:01:59.689
"But he must be alive!" he said.

31
00:01:59.690 --> 00:02:03.398
"Let me try to find him, Doctor," Jip offered.

32
00:02:03.399 --> 00:02:10.340
"You? How can YOU find him?" laughed Gub-Gub.

33
00:02:10.341 --> 00:02:15.675
"Dogs have a great sense of smell," Jip growled.

34
00:02:15.676 --> 00:02:18.353
The other animals laughed at Jip.

35
00:02:18.354 --> 00:02:23.459
"Dolphins and eagles are the smartest creatures," Dab-Dab pointed out.

36
00:02:23.460 --> 00:02:24.835
"They couldn't find him.

37
00:02:24.836 --> 00:02:26.538
So how can you?"

38
00:02:26.539 --> 00:02:29.355
"I'll find the uncle!" Jip barked.

39
00:02:29.356 --> 00:02:33.397
"Just you wait and see!"

40
00:02:33.398 --> 00:02:36.334
Jip spoke quietly to the doctor.

41
00:02:36.335 --> 00:02:41.076
"Do you have something of your uncle's?" Dr. Dolittle asked the boy.

42
00:02:41.077 --> 00:02:45.674
"Only this," the boy took out a red handkerchief.

43
00:02:45.675 --> 00:02:48.976
Jip sniffed and smelled the handkerchief.

44
00:02:48.977 --> 00:02:53.601
"I smell pickles and lemons," Jip said.

45
00:02:53.602 --> 00:02:55.925
Dr. Dolittle asked the boy:

46
00:02:55.926 --> 00:02:59.222
"Does your uncle like pickles and lemons?"

47
00:02:59.223 --> 00:03:01.911
"Yes! How did you know?"

48
00:03:01.912 --> 00:03:04.084
The boy was surprised.

49
00:03:04.085 --> 00:03:09.618
"He carries them in a jar and eats them all the time."

50
00:03:09.619 --> 00:03:13.617
Everyone watched as Jip smelled and smelled the air.

51
00:03:13.618 --> 00:03:19.712
"Onions, wet raincoats, burning leaves," Jip mumbled.

52
00:03:19.713 --> 00:03:24.849
"Can you really smell all those things?" Dr. Dolittle asked.

53
00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:30.988
"Of course! The wind carries the smell," Jip replied.

54
00:03:30.989 --> 00:03:33.141
Many hours went by.

55
00:03:33.142 --> 00:03:37.007
"He's not going to find the uncle," Gub-Gub sighed.

56
00:03:37.008 --> 00:03:38.919
"Let's go and eat."

57
00:03:38.920 --> 00:03:42.321
Suddenly, Jip let out a sharp cry.

58
00:03:42.322 --> 00:03:48.286
"Pickles and lemons! Over there!"
